{
    "chapter_num": 1,
    "verses_count": 22,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Job and His Family in Uz"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "There was a man in the land of Uz, whose name "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Job; and that man was blameless and upright, and one who feared God and "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. turned away from"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "shunned evil. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And seven sons and three daughters were born to him. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Also, his possessions were seven thousand sheep, three thousand camels, five hundred yoke of oxen, five hundred female donkeys, and a very large household, so that this man was the greatest of all the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. sons"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "people of the East."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And his sons would go and feast "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "in their"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " houses, each on his "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "appointed"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " day, and would send and invite their three sisters to eat and drink with them. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So it was, when the days of feasting had run their course, that Job would send and "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "consecrate"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "sanctify them, and he would rise early in the morning and offer burnt offerings "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "according to"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the number of them all. For Job said, “It may be that my sons have sinned and cursed"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. blessed, but in an evil sense; cf. Job 1:11; 2:5, 9"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " God in their hearts.” Thus Job did regularly."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Satan Attacks Job’s Character"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now there was a day when the sons of God came to present themselves before the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": ", and "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. the Adversary"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Satan also came among them. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " said to "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. the Adversary"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Satan, “From where do you come?”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So Satan answered the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " and said, “From going to and fro on the earth, and from walking back and forth on it.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " said to Satan, “Have you "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. set your heart on"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "considered My servant Job, that "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "there is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " none like him on the earth, a blameless and upright man, one who fears God and "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. turns away from"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "shuns evil?”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So Satan answered the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " and said, “Does Job fear God for nothing? "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Have You not "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Protected him"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "made a hedge around him, around his household, and around all that he has on every side? You have blessed the work of his hands, and his possessions have increased in the land. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But now, stretch out Your hand and touch all that he has, and he will surely curse"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. bless, but in an evil sense; cf. Job 1:5"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " You to Your face!”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " said to Satan, “Behold, all that he has "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " in your "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. hand"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "power; only do not lay a hand on his "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "person."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So Satan went out from the presence of the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Job Loses His Property and Children"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now there was a day when his sons and daughters "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " eating and drinking wine in their oldest brother’s house; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "and a messenger came to Job and said, “The oxen were plowing and the donkeys feeding beside them, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "when the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. Sheba; cf. Job 6:19"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Sabeans "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. fell upon"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "raided "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "them"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " and took them away—indeed they have killed the servants with the edge of the sword; and I alone have escaped to tell you!”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "While he "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " still speaking, another also came and said, “The fire of God fell from heaven and burned up the sheep and the servants, and "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "destroyed"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "consumed them; and I alone have escaped to tell you!”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 17,
                    "num_str": "17",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "While he "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " still speaking, another also came and said, “The Chaldeans formed three bands, raided the camels and took them away, yes, and killed the servants with the edge of the sword; and I alone have escaped to tell you!”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 18,
                    "num_str": "18",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "While he "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " still speaking, another also came and said, “Your sons and daughters "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " eating and drinking wine in their oldest brother’s house, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 19,
                    "num_str": "19",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "and suddenly a great wind came from "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "LXX omits across"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "across the wilderness and struck the four corners of the house, and it fell on the young people, and they are dead; and I alone have escaped to tell you!”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 20,
                    "num_str": "20",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then Job arose, tore his robe, and shaved his head; and he fell to the ground and worshiped. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 21,
                    "num_str": "21",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And he said:"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "“Naked I came from my mother’s womb,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And naked shall I return there."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "The "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " gave, and the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " has taken away;"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Blessed be the name of the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": ".”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 22,
                    "num_str": "22",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "In all this Job did not sin nor charge God with wrong."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}